# Paths excluded from the PR size count.
# Syntax is the same as .gitignore (leading / anchors to the root, trailing /
# matches a directory, * ** ? are supported, ! negates, # comments).
#
# Only list things whose line count says nothing about review effort.
# Anything not listed here is counted and subject to the line limit.
# Patches (*.patch) and the build script are counted. Do not add them here.

# Research notes and work instructions; being long is normal
docs/

# Upstream license text, carried verbatim
LICENSE

# Images and design files
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.svg
*.ico
*.icns
*.sketch
*.pdf

# Xcode / SwiftPM generated files
*.pbxproj
*.xcworkspacedata
*.xcscheme
xcuserdata/
Package.resolved
